    <briefdescription>
<para>Operator-facing diagnostics module for update incident detection and recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="since"><para>2.4.0 (Q4 2026)</para>
</simplesect>
Provides structured failure detection, alerting rules, and recovery procedures for common update scenarios:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Coordinator unreachability and timeout cycles</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Partial migration failures with recovery ambiguity</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Canary rollout failures and timeout loops</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Node failures during blue-green rollback</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Resource exhaustion scenarios</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Manifest corruption and degradation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cluster partition handling</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Deadlock/race condition detection</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Supports machine-parseable alerting rules for observability tools (Prometheus, Grafana).</para>
<para>Doxygen maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
    </detaileddescription>
